---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: "/resources/cold-call-audio-examples/"
title: "B2B Cold Call Examples You Can Listen To"
seoTitle: "B2B Cold Call Examples You Can Listen To | CallTeam"
description: "Listen to B2B cold call examples with transcripts. Hear openers, voicemail, objection replies, callbacks and how to ask for a qualified meeting."
canonicalUrl: "https://www.callteam.ca/resources/cold-call-audio-examples/"
date: "2026-11-25"
modified: "2026-11-25"
pageStyles: ["/assets/css/lead-providers.css", "/assets/css/calling-lessons.css", "/assets/css/process-video-preview.css", "/assets/css/cold-call-audio-examples.css"]
pageScripts: ["/assets/js/calling-lessons.js", "/assets/js/cold-call-audio-examples.js"]
---
{% from "components/inline-video.njk" import videoPlayer %}
{% from "components/calling-lesson.njk" import copy, transcript %}
{% set opener = callingLessons.opener %}
{% set information = callingLessons.information %}
{% set fleet = coldCallExamples[0] %}
{% set callback = {
  asset: "callteam-call-me-next-week",
  title: "What to say when they ask for a callback",
  transcript: "When a buyer says, ‘Call me next week,’ agree on when and what you'll pick up. Say, ‘Sure. Would Tuesday at ten Eastern work? We can pick up on how invoice approvals work across your branches.’ If they agree, log the date, time zone and reason. Mark it as a callback. When you ring them, say, ‘You asked me to call back about invoice approvals. Is now still a good time?’ Then let them answer."
} %}

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "CollectionPage",
      "@id": "{{ canonicalUrl }}#webpage",
      "url": "{{ canonicalUrl }}",
      "name": {{ title | json | safe }},
      "description": {{ description | json | safe }},
      "inLanguage": "en",
      "isPartOf": {"@id": "{{ site.websiteId }}"},
      "publisher": {"@id": "{{ site.organizationId }}"},
      "breadcrumb": {"@id": "{{ canonicalUrl }}#breadcrumb"},
      "mainEntity": {"@id": "{{ canonicalUrl }}#calling-examples"}
    },
    {
      "@type": "ItemList",
      "@id": "{{ canonicalUrl }}#calling-examples",
      "name": "Cold call audio examples from CallTeam",
      "numberOfItems": {{ 4 + (coldCallPracticeDemos | length) }},
      "itemListElement": [
        {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Hear the opener and pause", "url": "{{ canonicalUrl }}#opener"},
        {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "When they say Send me information", "url": "{{ canonicalUrl }}#send-me-information"},
        {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "When they say Call me next week", "url": "{{ canonicalUrl }}#callback"},
        {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 4, "name": "Fleet repair cold call demo", "url": "{{ canonicalUrl }}#fleet-repair"}{% for demo in coldCallPracticeDemos %},
        {"@type": "ListItem", "position": {{ 4 + loop.index }}, "name": {{ demo.title | json | safe }}, "url": "{{ canonicalUrl }}#{{ demo.id }}"}{% endfor %}
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      "@id": "{{ canonicalUrl }}#breadcrumb",
      "itemListElement": [
        {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "{{ site.url }}/"},
        {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Cold Call Scripts", "item": "{{ site.url }}/resources/cold-call-scripts/"},
        {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Cold Call Audio Examples", "item": "{{ canonicalUrl }}"}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
</script>

<main class="lp-page cae-page" id="main-content">
  <div class="lp-hero-shell">
    <div class="lp-wrap">
      <nav class="lp-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <a href="/resources/cold-call-scripts/">Cold Call Scripts</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <span aria-current="page">Audio Examples</span>
      </nav>
      <div class="lp-hero cae-hero">
        <div>
          <h1>B2B Cold Call Examples <span>You Can Listen To</span></h1>
          <p class="lp-intro">Hear how to open a cold call, leave a voicemail and handle common objections. Every clip has captions and a transcript.</p>
          <p class="cae-provenance">CallTeam built these practice demos from its cold call scripts and materials used in real client campaigns.</p>
          <div class="lp-actions">
            <a class="lp-button" href="#opener" data-inline-play>Play the opener</a>
            <a class="lp-text-link" href="#fleet-repair">Hear the fleet repair call</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <article class="cae-spotlight" id="opener" aria-labelledby="cae-opener-title">
          <div class="cae-media">
            {{ videoPlayer(opener.asset, 720, 1280, opener.title, {poster: true, captions: true, placement: "audio-examples-opener"}) }}
          </div>
          <div class="cae-spotlight-text">
            <p class="lp-kicker">CallTeam coaching clip · {{ opener.label }}</p>
            <h2 id="cae-opener-title">Hear the opener and pause</h2>
            <p>Ask the question once. Give the buyer time to finish their answer.</p>
            {{ transcript(opener, "cae-opener-transcript") }}
            <a href="{{ opener.url }}#copy-opener">Read the opener script and notes</a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <nav class="lp-jump" aria-label="Audio examples on this page">
    <div class="lp-wrap">
      <a href="#opener">The opener</a>
      <a href="#send-me-information">Send me information</a>
      <a href="#callback">The callback</a>
      <a href="#fleet-repair">Fleet repair demo</a>
      {% for demo in coldCallPracticeDemos %}<a href="#{{ demo.id }}">{{ demo.jumpLabel }}</a>{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </nav>

  <section class="lp-section lp-paper" id="opening-line">
    <div class="lp-wrap cae-opening">
      <div>
        <h2>A cold call opener you can copy</h2>
        <p>Ask who handles a task the buyer recognises. Their answer tells you who to speak with.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cae-say">
        <blockquote id="cae-opener-words">When there is a company you would like to win, who makes the first call?</blockquote>
        {{ copy("cae-opener-words", "Copy the opening question") }}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="lp-section" id="send-me-information" aria-labelledby="cae-information-title">
    <div class="lp-wrap cae-lesson">
      <div class="cae-media">
        {{ videoPlayer(information.asset, 720, 1280, information.title, {poster: true, captions: true, placement: "audio-examples-information"}) }}
      </div>
      <div class="cae-lesson-body">
        <p class="lp-kicker">CallTeam coaching clip · {{ information.label }}</p>
        <h2 id="cae-information-title">When they say “Send me information”</h2>
        <p>Find out what they want to see. Agree on a follow-up only when the buyer gives you a reason to continue.</p>
        <div class="cae-say">
          <blockquote id="cae-information-words">Sure. What would be most useful: how the approval process works, or an example from a similar company?</blockquote>
          {{ copy("cae-information-words", "Copy the reply") }}
        </div>
        {{ transcript(information, "cae-information-transcript") }}
        <a href="{{ information.url }}">Read the full objection guide</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="lp-section lp-paper" id="callback" aria-labelledby="cae-callback-title">
    <div class="lp-wrap cae-lesson">
      <div class="cae-media">
        {{ videoPlayer(callback.asset, 1080, 1920, callback.title, {poster: true, captions: true, placement: "audio-examples-callback"}) }}
      </div>
      <div class="cae-lesson-body">
        <p class="lp-kicker">CallTeam coaching clip · 30-second lesson</p>
        <h2 id="cae-callback-title">When they say “Call me next week”</h2>
        <p>Agree on a day, time zone and topic while you have them on the phone. On the return call, remind them what they wanted to discuss.</p>
        <div class="cae-say">
          <blockquote id="cae-callback-words">You asked me to call back about invoice approvals. Is now still a good time?</blockquote>
          {{ copy("cae-callback-words", "Copy the callback opener") }}
        </div>
        {{ transcript(callback, "cae-callback-transcript") }}
        <a href="/b2b-cold-calling-campaign-process/">See how CallTeam tracks callbacks</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="lp-section" id="fleet-repair" aria-labelledby="cae-fleet-title">
    <div class="lp-wrap">
      <div class="lp-heading">
        <h2 id="cae-fleet-title">Practise the fleet repair cold call</h2>
        <p>A body shop asks when the fleet can turn to a backup supplier.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cae-dialogue-grid">
        <article class="cae-dialogue">
          <div class="cae-dialogue-player">
            <p class="lp-kicker">Scripted practice demo</p>
            {{ videoPlayer("callteam-fleet-repair-cold-call-demo", 1920, 1080, "Fleet repair cold call demo", {poster: true, captions: true, placement: "audio-examples-fleet-repair"}) }}
          </div>
          <h3>Two-person practice script</h3>
          <dl id="cae-fleet-words">
            <div><dt>Caller</dt><dd>{{ fleet.opener }}</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Fleet manager</dt><dd>We decide here, but we already have a shop.</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Caller</dt><dd>{{ fleet.response }}</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Fleet manager</dt><dd>Yes, if ours can’t give us an estimate date.</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Caller</dt><dd>Which vehicles would you send out in that situation?</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Fleet manager</dt><dd>Mainly service vans. A few are high-roof.</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Caller</dt><dd>Does purchasing have to add us before you can request an estimate?</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Fleet manager</dt><dd>I can ask for a quote. Purchasing approves the shop before we send a van.</dd></div>
          </dl>
          <div class="cae-script-actions">
            {{ copy("cae-fleet-words", "Copy the practice script") }}
            <a href="/resources/cold-call-scripts/{{ fleet.slug }}/">{{ fleet.sourceLabel }}</a>
          </div>
        </article>
        <aside class="cae-proof" aria-labelledby="cae-proof-title">
          <p class="lp-kicker">CallTeam campaign records</p>
          <h3 id="cae-proof-title">Fleet repair campaign results</h3>
          <p>November 2–24, 2026</p>
          <dl class="cae-results">
            <div><dt>Logged call attempts</dt><dd>880</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Meetings booked</dt><dd>27</dd></div>
          </dl>
          <p>Callers asked which vehicles needed repairs and where the fleet operated.</p>
          <a href="/resources/b2b-cold-calling-report/#fleet-source">Fleet campaign records and counting rules</a>
          <h3>What to pass along</h3>
          <p>Record the vehicle types, when the fleet uses a backup and who approves the shop.</p>
          <p>Want CallTeam to run your calling campaign? <a href="https://calendly.com/hello-callteam/new-meeting" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-booking-placement="audio-examples-fleet-proof"><strong>Book a free 30-minute call</strong></a>.</p>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {% for demo in coldCallPracticeDemos %}
  <section class="lp-section cae-practice" id="{{ demo.id }}" aria-labelledby="{{ demo.id }}-title">
    <div class="lp-wrap">
      <div class="lp-heading">
        <h2 id="{{ demo.id }}-title">{{ demo.title }}</h2>
        <p>{{ demo.intro }}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cae-dialogue-grid">
        <article class="cae-dialogue">
          <div class="cae-dialogue-player">
            <p class="lp-kicker">Scripted practice demo</p>
            {{ videoPlayer(demo.asset, 1920, 1080, demo.title, {poster: true, captions: true, placement: "audio-examples-" + demo.id}) }}
          </div>
          <details class="ctl-transcript">
            <summary>Read the transcript</summary>
            <dl id="{{ demo.id }}-transcript">
              {% for turn in demo.turns %}<div><dt>{{ turn.speaker }}</dt><dd>{{ turn.line }}</dd></div>{% endfor %}
            </dl>
            {{ copy(demo.id + "-transcript", "Copy the practice script") }}
          </details>
        </article>
        <aside class="cae-proof" aria-labelledby="{{ demo.id }}-note">
          <h3 id="{{ demo.id }}-note">{{ demo.takeawayHeading }}</h3>
          <p>{{ demo.takeaway }}</p>
          <a href="{{ demo.sourceUrl }}">{{ demo.sourceLabel }}</a>
          <div class="cae-demo-resource">
            {% if demo.relatedText %}<p>{{ demo.relatedText }}</p>{% endif %}
            <a href="{{ demo.relatedUrl }}">{{ demo.relatedLabel }}</a>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  {% endfor %}

  <section class="lp-section lp-paper lp-close" aria-labelledby="cae-next-title">
    <div class="lp-wrap lp-close-grid">
      <div>
        <h2 id="cae-next-title">Try your own opening line</h2>
        <p>Pick a buyer and write one question about how they handle the work today. Run it through the free Script Checker before you practise it aloud.</p>
        <div class="lp-actions">
          <a class="lp-button" href="/cold-call-script-checker/">Check your cold call script</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside>
        <h3>Keep practising</h3>
        <a href="/resources/cold-call-scripts/">Browse the free B2B scripts</a>
        <a href="/articles/b2b-cold-calling-strategy/">Read the B2B cold calling guide</a>
        <a href="/services/b2b-cold-calling/">Have CallTeam make the calls</a>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
